# Production Environment Variables Example
# Copy this to document your production configuration
# DO NOT commit actual production values to git

# CHAI Agent Configuration
# Set these via Firebase environment config or Secret Manager

# BuyBot User ID (from Production Firebase Auth)
# Get this after creating BuyBot user in production
BUYBOT_USER_ID=your-production-buybot-uid-here

# Power User IDs (comma-separated list)
# Add all users who should be able to approve purchases
POWER_USER_IDS=production-power-user-uid-1,production-power-user-uid-2

# Note: TEST_MODE should NOT be set in production
# Leaving it unset defaults to production mode (real GPT-4 calls)
